    "title": "Place preview — experimental MOCK contract draft",
    "version": "0.1.0-draft",
    "description": "Default disabled (404). Opt-in app.place-preview.enabled=true is MOCK-only and requires a trusted Servlet Principal (401 otherwise). Login/authentication protocol and UI agreement are not implemented; do not deploy publicly. No header/body owner or fake-login fallback. Existing /api/v1 contract remains 1.0.0. All bodies are no-store. No DB/place cache, reservation linkage, navigation/ETA claims or live calls."
  },
